{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/actionsportrentals-paradisepointresort/items/633989/", "pk": 633989, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/actionsportrentals-paradisepointresort/", "pk": 96274, "shortname": "actionsportrentals-paradisepointresort", "name": "Action Sport Rentals - Paradise Point Resort", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Bare Boat Rental - Speed Boat Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 7, "unicode": "Bare Boat Rental - Speed Boat Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 24.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": false, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 24.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": false, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": 1, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": true, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 35000, "description": "### Want a high speed thrill but don't want to operate a powerboat rental boat yourself?\n\n##Duration & Rates\t\t\t\t\t\n- Two Hours\n- Rates are seasonal and may vary. The correct rate will display once you make your date and duration selection during the booking process.\n- Driver must be paid cash at the rate of $50 an hour \n\n#Pick up locations\n- Paradise Point Resort & Spa (RECOMENDED): 1404 W Vacation Way\n\n- Bahia Resort: 998 W Mission Bay Dr\n\n- Catamaran Resort: 3981 W Mission Bay Blvd\n\n##About\nGet ready for a thrilling blend of high-octane excitement and laid-back sightseeing as you are taken on an unforgettable speed boat tour around the scenic west end of Mission Bay! Whether you’re craving adrenaline or just want to kick back and enjoy the views, this tour delivers the perfect mix of both.\nIt can accommodate up to 8 passengers!\n\n##What's Included\t\t\t\t\t\n- Stereo System\n- Life Jackets\n\n##What to Bring\t\t\t\t\t\n- Sunscreen\n- Water bottles (No glass please)\n- Food and Drink is 100% allowed and encouraged while onboard. (No glass please)\n- Ice\n- Don't want to bring your own snacks and beverages, stop by Dana Landing Market by boat to pick up your essentials. Don't forget to check out their deli menu!   \n  https://www.danalanding.com/   \n- Towels & Blankets\n- Camera or something to document your amazing time on the water with. (Don’t forget to tag/mention us on social media)", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#We look forward to you joining us!\n\nImportant information to know before your rental:\n\n1. Please arrive 15 minutes prior to your reservation start time. Your rental duration starts at the time of your reservation.\n2. Complete the online waiver in this confirmation email prior to arrival.\n3. Bring the credit card that was used to make the reservation and the matching drivers license/ID.\n\nHere is a list of guides to choose from:\n1. Jane Yarbrough\n2. Jacob Steevens\n3. Ryan Gilligan\n4. Joe Tucker\n5. Collin Hilliard", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "2 Hours • Up to 8 people", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/actionsportrentals-paradisepointresort/items/633989/images/1478381/", "pk": 1478381, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/OJiNPwlYQlaHDU6gDwva", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/OJiNPwlYQlaHDU6gDwva", "company": {"cls": "Company", "